---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden pb-24 sm:pb-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="reveal relative grid items-center gap-10 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-caparol/15 bg-azul/30 p-8 sm:p-12 md:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Decorative open-book glyph -->
      <svg
        class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none absolute -top-6 -right-6 -z-10 hidden h-44 w-44 text-arena/15 md:block lg:h-56 lg:w-56"
        viewBox="0 0 120 120"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.4"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M10 32 Q 35 22 60 32 Q 85 22 110 32 L 110 92 Q 85 82 60 92 Q 35 82 10 92 Z" />
        <path d="M60 32 L 60 92" />
        <path d="M20 44 Q 38 38 56 44" />
        <path d="M20 56 Q 38 50 56 56" />
        <path d="M64 44 Q 82 38 100 44" />
        <path d="M64 56 Q 82 50 100 56" />
      </svg>

      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <p class="font-hand text-2xl leading-none text-celeste sm:text-3xl">
          ¿quieres leerlo entero?
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,4vw,2.75rem)] leading-[0.95] text-caparol">
          Lleva el cuento
          <span class="block"><span class="hand-underline text-arena">a casa</span></span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base text-caparol/85 sm:text-lg">
          Vive la historia completa y descubre la realidad aumentada que
          solo funciona con el cuento en formato físico. Los protagonistas
          salen de las páginas para nadar contigo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 md:col-span-5">
        <li>
          <a
            href="/comprar"
            class="group flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-caparol/15 bg-azul/40 p-5 transition hover:border-arena focus:outline-none focus-visible:border-arena"
          >
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-arena/10 text-arena transition group-hover:bg-arena group-hover:text-azul">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3 7h18l-2 13H5z" />
                <path d="M8 7V5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
              <span class="font-display text-lg text-caparol">Dónde comprarlo</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-caparol/70">Online y librerías de Canarias</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="/contacto"
            class="group flex h-full flex-col items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-caparol/15 bg-azul/40 p-5 transition hover:border-celeste focus:outline-none focus-visible:border-celeste"
          >
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-celeste/15 text-celeste transition group-hover:bg-celeste group-hover:text-azul">
              <Icon name="game-icons:fishing-net" class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
            </span>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5">
              <span class="font-display text-lg text-caparol">Pedidos en lote</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-caparol/70">Colegios, bibliotecas, ONGs</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
